         "text": "Differentiate both sides of \\( x^{2} y = 18 \\) with respect to \\( t \\), using the product rule on the term that contains both variables: \\( \\left(2 x y\\right)\\frac{dx}{dt} + \\left(x^{2}\\right)\\frac{dy}{dt} = 0 \\).",
